#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:5 a450b68bb5c3462faf367f2d6210235e
msgid "Tuning Cruise Configuration"
msgstr "巡航配置调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:9 19079e35da2d4bd59081a2c0be54f34f
msgid "Overview of Constant Altitude, Level Flight Operation"
msgstr "恒定高度平飞操作概述"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:11 7d8f1dac07494906830ebe8756eaad99
msgid ""
"\"Hands-off\" constant altitude hold cruising occurs in automatic throttle "
"modes such as FBWB, CRUISE, AUTO, GUIDED, CIRCLE, LOITER, RTL, etc. See "
":ref:`flight-modes` for the full list of automatic throttle modes."
msgstr ""
"「不干预」恒定高度保持巡航发生在自动油门模式下，如FBWB、CRUISE、AUTO、GUIDED、CIRCLE、LOITER、RTL等。参见 "
":ref:`flight-modes` 以获取自动油门模式的完整列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:13 457accd71e504329880dfb147593f8d3
msgid ""
"In FBWB and CRUISE modes, without an airspeed sensor, the autopilot will set"
" the target throttle at :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` with the "
"throttle at mid-stick, and adjust pitch to hold altitude. The airspeed will "
"be whatever results from the change in thrust. Raising the throttle stick "
"will increase throttle and thereby airspeed."
msgstr ""
"在FBWB和CRUISE模式下，若没有空速传感器，飞控将在油门摇杆居中时将目标油门设置为 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>`，并调整俯仰以保持高度。空速将由推力变化的结果决定。提高油门摇杆将增加油门进而增加空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:15 c8fbfa63a9604c91bfe3e02077b11807
msgid ""
"When using an airspeed sensor, the autopilot will use throttle position to "
"set the target airspeed as a linear interpolation between "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` and :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`. And"
" pitch will be adjusted for constant altitude flight."
msgstr ""
"使用空速传感器时，飞控将使用油门摇杆位置在 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` （高位摇杆）和 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` （低位摇杆）之间线性插值设置目标空速，并调整俯仰以保持恒定高度飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:17 8e2693c1f80146ae8a01e87a7199a043
msgid ""
"In the automatic throttle controlled modes, "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` is used for the target airspeed if "
"an airspeed sensor is being used, while :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"will be set for the average throttle value if no sensor is used. In AUTO and"
" GUIDED modes, the :ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` option allows the "
"pilot to tweak these values while in flight with the throttle, if desired, "
"in these modes."
msgstr ""
"在自动油门控制模式下，如果使用空速传感器，:ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"用于目标空速；如果不使用传感器，:ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"将设置为平均油门值。在AUTO和GUIDED模式下，如果需要，:ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` "
"选项允许飞手在飞行中用油门微调这些值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:19 ec3a05c3cb404ebf940d8ee464f70ca3
msgid ""
"While :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` is not used when using an airspeed"
" sensor directly, it is important to set it at a working value since it will"
" be used in case of an airspeed sensor failure."
msgstr ""
"虽然使用空速传感器时 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"不会直接使用，但将其设置为有效值非常重要，因为在空速传感器故障时将使用它。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:22 ccb97b4badfc43fca7b86fa04cbc2c02
msgid "AHRS Level Attitude"
msgstr "AHRS 水平姿态"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:24 cb3bdb14b59d4cf5988471d8aaeb17ab
msgid ""
"During :ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration`, a \"level\" attitude "
"position is set with the wings and fuselage perfectly level. A plane can fly"
" holding a constant altitude at range of speeds, depending on throttle level"
" and Angle of Attack (AOA)."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration` "
"期间，会在机翼和机身完全水平的情况下设置「水平」姿态位置。飞机可以在一系列速度下保持恒定高度飞行，具体取决于油门水平和迎角（AOA）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:28 5b05ddafb60542a5b1c96f40d4e0bb22
msgid ""
"The AOA is usually several degrees but varies depending on cruise "
"speed/throttle. This is the \"trim level\" pitch. This is explained in the "
"diagrams above and is known as the \"trim level\" condition. While many "
"planes will have some Angle of Incidence (i.e. the cord of the wing is at a "
"positive angle to the fuselage cord) built-in, some do not, and some need a "
"slightly higher AOA to fly at desired cruise speeds."
msgstr ""
"AOA通常为几度，但根据巡航速度/油门而变化。这就是「配平水平」俯仰。如上图所示，这被称为「配平水平」状态。虽然许多飞机内置了一定的入射角（即机翼弦线相对于机身弦线成正角），但有些飞机没有，有些飞机需要稍大的AOA才能以所需巡航速度飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:30 24956c3919c947f1af7af0ca8e50a287
msgid ""
"If the level step of calibration is done with the plane's fuselage line "
"level, initial flights will be safe, but the aircraft may not hold altitude "
"at the desired flying speed in non-altitude controlled modes (i.e. require "
"too much throttle to hold altitude and/or the cruising speed may be faster "
"or slower than desired)."
msgstr ""
"如果校准的水平步骤是在飞机机身线水平时完成的，初始飞行将是安全的，但在非高度控制模式下，飞机可能无法以所需飞行速度保持高度（即需要太多油门才能保持高度，和/或巡航速度可能比所需更快或更慢）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:33 e5e155fc1fc746c9b19bafd87f2b1829
msgid "Adjusting FBWB or CRUISE Mode Airspeed"
msgstr "调整FBWB或CRUISE模式空速"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:35 0f3467899d704378afd4cfdb406bdcab
msgid ""
"The autopilot's goal in automatic throttle modes is to obtain the correct "
"combination of elevator and throttle to maintain constant altitude flight. "
"How the autopilot does this is detailed in :ref:`tecs-total-energy-control-"
"system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide`."
msgstr ""
"飞控在自动油门模式下的目标是获得正确的升降舵和油门组合以维持恒定高度飞行。飞控如何实现这一目标在 :ref:`tecs-total-energy-"
"control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide` 中有详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:38 485c7c6a3d7942ce9215133ce562d0d6
msgid "When an Airspeed Sensor is Enabled"
msgstr "启用空速传感器时"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:40 0efeb1bea92640f5a0c189c7e14205d6
msgid ""
"In FBWB or CRUISE, the target airspeed can be directly controlled with the "
"throttle stick position. Mid throttle will set the speed as halfway between "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` (high stick) and "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` (low stick)."
msgstr ""
"在FBWB或CRUISE模式下，目标空速可以直接通过油门摇杆位置控制。油门中位将设置速度为 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` （高位摇杆）和 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` "
"（低位摇杆）之间的中间值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:42 0fbc0d74a24746ca92b825fc22d0c72a
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` parameter should be adjusted to the "
"average throttle value used at cruise speed. It optimizes the bias point for"
" the speed control loops and is used in case of airspeed failure."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"参数应调整为巡航速度时使用的平均油门值。它优化了速度控制回路的偏置点，并在空速故障时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:44 72596f6cea2f451c97999acee208f48d
msgid ""
"While cruising, the artificial horizon in the OSD or GCS may show an average"
" positive or negative pitch above the level indicator (ie fuselage/autopilot"
" level). This means that the \"trim level\" pitch or AOA is different than "
"what was set during the accelerometer calibration step. This can be trimmed "
"out so that non altitude controlled modes fly at the same speed and "
"throttle. Do this by adjusting the pitch trim, adding the desired degrees "
"nose up or down using :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>`. This also "
"optimizes the speed control loop bias point and will allow non altitude "
"controlled modes to fly level at the same throttle and speed."
msgstr ""
"巡航时，OSD或GCS中的人工地平线可能会显示高于水平指示器（即机身/飞控水平）的平均正或负俯仰。这意味着「配平水平」俯仰或AOA与加速度计校准步骤中设置的不同。可以通过调整俯仰配平来消除这一差异，使用"
" :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` "
"添加所需的机头上仰或下俯度数，使非高度控制模式以相同的油门和速度平飞。这也优化了速度控制回路偏置点，并允许非高度控制模式以相同的油门和速度平飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:46 fee0ebb3852243408c39a69c5917e11d
msgid ""
"Using :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to adjust cruise attitude will "
"also add an offset to the artificial horizon on a GCS or an OSD, but this "
"can be disabled, if desired, using the :ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>`"
" bitmask bits 8 and/or 9, if the attitude of the autopilot in level flight "
"is desired, rather than a leveled artificial horizon when flying level ."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` "
"调整巡航姿态也会在GCS或OSD上的人工地平线添加偏移，但如果需要，可以使用 :ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>`"
" 位掩码的第8位和/或第9位禁用，如果希望显示飞控在平飞时的姿态而不是平飞时调平的人工地平线。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:49 3282a99c8c7d4cc3bafec2ff35700a2e
msgid "Without an Airspeed Sensor"
msgstr "不使用空速传感器时"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:51 1dfd27a20edd4240a9039a2ea433c045
msgid ""
"Without an airspeed sensor, both the pitch trim and the "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` parameter would need to be changed "
"appropriately for the desired mid-stick cruise speed."
msgstr ""
"不使用空速传感器时，俯仰配平和 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 参数都需要根据所需的油门中位巡航速度适当调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:53 34a7231a22314199b8aa3eced7bf0914
msgid ""
"Often planes need 2 or 3 degrees of pitch trim to fly at their optimum "
"cruising speed/throttle rather than at the fuselage/autopilot level pitch, "
"especially small light planes or gliders. This can be done at setup by:"
msgstr ""
"飞机通常需要2或3度的俯仰配平才能以最佳巡航速度/油门飞行，而非以机身/飞控水平俯仰飞行，小型轻型飞机或滑翔机尤为如此。可以在设置时通过以下方式完成："

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:55 5a7cb499cbe4484bb61a5a9010325844
msgid ""
"**(Preferred)** Add the desired degrees nose up(usually) or down to "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>`."
msgstr "**(推荐)** 向 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 添加所需的机头上仰（通常）或下俯度数。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:56 6d107c58e4144a5d86675c774258d3f8
msgid ""
"Position vehicle with a few degrees nose up or down during the first, Level "
"step of accelerometer calibration to match the cruising attitude."
msgstr "在加速度计校准的第一步「水平」步骤中，将飞行器放置为几度机头上仰或下俯，以匹配巡航姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:57 44db15c832f541ce9f4520d44fefd1a7
msgid ""
"Position vehicle with a few degrees nose up and use the  ``Calibrate Level``"
" button on the Mission Planner page. This adjusts the AHRS_TRIM parameters. "
"AHRS_TRIM parameters can only change the difference between the autopilot's "
"plane and \"level\" by 10 degrees maximum. If more is needed, (e.g. the "
"autopilot is mounted slightly downward), then you can use "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to alter the AOA manually."
msgstr ""
"将飞行器放置为几度机头上仰，并使用Mission Planner页面上的 ``Calibrate Level`` "
"按钮。这会调整AHRS_TRIM参数。AHRS_TRIM参数只能将飞控平面和「水平」之间的差值更改最多10度。如果需要更多（例如飞控安装略微朝下），则可以使用"
" :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 手动调整AOA。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:59 e1b6d56572354c9e9f483d11ac3bd93f
msgid ""
"You can examine ATT.DesPitch in the logs when at cruise speed in FBWB or "
"CRUISE to determine the average pitch trim required in these modes. "
"Appropriately adjusting :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to lower this to"
" zero when flying level in these modes."
msgstr ""
"在FBWB或CRUISE模式以巡航速度飞行时，可以查看日志中的ATT.DesPitch来确定这些模式所需的平均俯仰配平。适当调整 "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 使在这些模式平飞时该值降至零。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:61 b685a48eedbe4cfc8cf6dc1fc4717180
msgid ""
"when using :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to adjust trim, it will be "
"reflected in the ATT.Pitch log message, and also in the OSD and GCS horizon "
"displays (ie level horizon pitch = :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` + the"
" calibrated level pitch) so that the display will be level when flying \"in "
"trim\" even though the plane's pitch is different than the autopilots "
"calibrated pitch."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` "
"调整配平时，它将反映在ATT.Pitch日志消息以及OSD和GCS地平线显示中（即水平地平线俯仰 = "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` + "
"校准水平俯仰），这样即使飞机俯仰与飞控校准俯仰不同，「配平中」飞行时显示也将是水平的。"
